description:
We are a leading chartered accountancy firm established in 2009, rendering comprehensive professional services in the areas of:
Bank audit and assurance services;
Direct taxation;
Indirect taxation (GST);
Audit and assurance;
Due diligence;
Business and corporate advisory;
Knowledge process outsourcing;
Cross border transactions;

FCA P. N. Maitra, Lead Partner, has been in practice for more than 30 years. Our firm represents a combination of specialized skills, which are geared to offer financial advisory and personalized proactive services.
Our firm is empanelled with RBI as a Category II firm for conducting Statutory Branch audits of public sector banks.
